p = mean probability of the right next token (0 if it is not among the 20 most probable).
first = share of prompts where the right token is the first choice.
stale = share of prompts where the first choice is the token that is right with the newest 1-3 tokens gone.
'whole pools' = the length is a multiple of 4; 'part pool' = remainder 1, 2 or 3.

